name: xorinal
displayName: "[green]Beyond Serpulo[]"
author: "Oscar Moran"
description:
    '''
    Beyond Serpulo expands the Mindustry universe with new planets — Xorinal (organic spore world), Tetra (frost moon), and Vantres (blackened volcanic moon of Erekir). Currently v1.6. Firmly Beta. Try it and if you like it please star on github! Contact me at oscaremoran20@gmail.com. 
    UPDATES:
    LICHEN UPDATE (v1.2)
    FLAMEWAR UPDATE (v1.3)
    TETRA UPDATE (v1.4)
    QOL UPDATE (v1.5)
    PILOTS UPDATE (v1.6) 

    Please star if you like the mod! Our goal right now is 10 stars. If we get there, I'll add more campaign features!
    '''
subtitle: "Campaign Overhaul"
version: "1.6"
minGameVersion: "154"
main: "beyondserpulo.BeyondSerpuloMod"
repo: "oscaremoran/BeyondSerpulo-Mod"
java: true
